  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "opencore-amr 是一个开源的 AMR（自适应多速率）语音编解码器库，实现 3GPP TS 26.073 规范的 AMR 窄带（NB）编码与解码以及 3GPP TS 26.173 规范的 AMR-WB（宽带）解码，代码源自 OpenCORE 框架（Google Android 项目）。主要面向多媒体应用、通信软件和语音处理工具的开发者，通过 C API 提供 AMR 音频编解码能力。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "AMR 窄带编解码",
        "description": "实现 3GPP AMR-NB 标准，支持八种比特率（4.75/5.15/5.90/6.70/7.40/7.95/10.2/12.2 kbps）的编码与解码，包含 DTX（非连续发送）和 VAD（语音活动检测）功能。",
        "evidence": [
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/dec/src/amrdecode.cpp (AMRDecode)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/enc/src/amrencode.cpp (AMREncode)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/enc/src/sp_enc.cpp (GSMEncodeFrame)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/dec/src/sp_dec.cpp (Speech_Decode_Frame)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/enc/src/cod_amr.cpp (主编码逻辑)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/common/src/vad1.cpp / vad2.cpp (VAD)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_nb/enc/src/dtx_enc.cpp (DTX)",
          "amrnb/interf_enc.h / interf_dec.h (公共编码/解码 API)",
          "amrnb/wrapper.cpp (C 包装器)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "AMR-WB 宽带解码",
        "description": "实现 3GPP AMR-WB（G.722.2）标准的宽带语音解码，支持 6.60–23.85 kbps 共 9 种速率模式，提供 16kHz 采样率的宽带语音输出。",
        "evidence": [
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_wb/dec/src/pvamrwbdecoder.cpp (pvDecoder_AmrWb)",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_wb/dec/src/decoder_amr_wb.cpp",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_wb/dec/src/dec_acelp_4p_in_64.cpp",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_wb/dec/src/dec_gain2_amr_wb.cpp",
          "opencore/codecs_v2/audio/gsm_amr/amr_wb/dec/src/dtx_decoder_amr_wb.cpp",
          "amrwb/dec_if.h (D_IF_decode 公共解码 API)",
          "amrwb/wrapper.cpp (C 包装器)"
        ]
      }
    ],
